        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Axes, NumberPlane, ComplexPlane, PolarAxes and ThreeDAxes define mathematical ranges and physical dimensions. Their c2p/p2c methods map between mathematical and scene coordinates. rangeVersion lets dependent plots respond to range changes. Grid, axis and label style can be chosen separately."
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "example": "labs/pg-plotscene"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Axes](/api-entities-composites-coordinates#axes), [NumberPlane](/api-entities-composites-coordinates#numberplane), [ComplexPlane](/api-entities-composites-coordinates#complexplane), [PolarAxes](/api-entities-composites-coordinates#polaraxes), [ThreeDAxes](/api-entities-composites-coordinates#threedaxes)."
        }
